Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.71,0:00:51.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我曾为安布雷拉公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I worked for the Umbrella Corporation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:54.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个世上最大最强的公司效命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the largest and most powerful commercial entity in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.61,0:00:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我担任保安主任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was head of security{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,负责保护“蜂巢”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at a secret high-tech facility called The Hive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.05,0:01:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个发展实验性生化武器的地下高科技实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a giant underground laboratory developing experimentalviral weaponry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.43,0:01:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但意外发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there was an incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.03,0:01:12.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,病毒扩散，大家都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The virus escaped and everybody died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,问题是 他们并没有完全死掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trouble was they didn't stay dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.67,0:01:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,T病毒控制了他们的身体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The T-virus reanimated their bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我活了下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.15,0:01:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我和另一个人，环保份子麦特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Myself and one other an environmentalist named Matt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.75,0:01:34.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们逃出来时，却被安布雷拉的科学家捉住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we emerged, we were seized by Umbrella scientists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.09,0:01:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麦特和我被迫分开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Matt and I were separated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:39.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在突变，我要把他纳入奈密司计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's mutating. I want him in the Nemesis Program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.49,0:01:40.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麦特！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Matt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.63,0:01:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,送她到拉昆市的机构，组一队人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take her to the Raccoon City facility and assemble the team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,重开“蜂巢”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're reopening The Hive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.37,0:01:52.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要知道下面发生什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know what went on down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:55.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们以为灾难已经过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought we'd survived the horror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.51,0:02:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我们错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we were wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:09.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,《生化危机：启示录》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是拉昆第7台，现在报告气象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're watching Raccoon 7. Now the weather, with Terri Morales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.66,0:02:19.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在是上午6：10，气温已高达33度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's 6:10 in the a.m. And already the temperature has reached　a massive 92 degrees {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.53,0:02:22.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这股空前的热浪将继续发威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as this unprecedented heat wave continues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:26.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拉昆市晴天，吹西风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear skies in Raccoon City and a light breeze coming in from the west.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:31.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好消息，粉尘值只有0.7\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as a special bonus just for you, we have a pollen count of 0. 7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.91,0:02:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个值可是同期最低\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a record low for this time of year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,花粉热、气喘病患可以安心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good news for all you hay fever and asthma sufferers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:40.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来今天会是个晴朗的好日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All in all, it looks like it's gonna be another beautiful day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.95,0:02:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别转台，广告后是大众喜爱的假日热点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with us. After the break,we're gonna look at your favorite holiday hot spots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.53,0:02:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(蜂巢入口  拉昆市地下)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:15.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先遣小组前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Advance team, proceed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长官.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天哪！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.89,0:03:53.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(黑门大桥  拉昆市主要联外桥梁)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.61,0:04:16.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉，夫人，出了点意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse us, ma'am. There's been an incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉，先生，出了点意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse us, sir. There's been an incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.77,0:04:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,情况有多糟？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How bad is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:44.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你得跟我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must come with us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要带我女儿一起走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must get my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:46.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经有人在处理了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's taken care of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等，你干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:50.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们不明白，她去上学了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand. She's left for school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.47,0:05:13.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(拉昆市初中)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:35.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是UG7，完成撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is U-Gamma 7, evacuation complete{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:38.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过G12小组失去联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we just lost contact with Gamma 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.95,0:06:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(13小时后)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.13,0:06:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,12小队请求支援市政厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unit 12 calling for immediate backup at city hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,目前原因不明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still no explanation for this wave of unexplained killings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.77,0:06:20.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莫名杀戮持续横扫本市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is sweeping across the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:27.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,犯罪行为继续扩散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A deadly crime spree with no end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们需要支援！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Backup, we need backup now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟范伦婷说的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like Valentine told us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:36.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,休假员警立刻向执勤单位报到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Off-duty law enforcement personnel, report for duty immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.39,0:06:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快帮忙！这家伙疯了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us a hand over here, this guy's insane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是范伦婷！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Valentine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别开枪！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:58.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,范伦婷！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Valentine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:06:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们受到感染了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.24,0:07:01.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快帮我拉开这个丑女！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody get this ugly bitch off of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:02.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.11,0:07:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要射脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot for the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托！快拉住她！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, somebody get her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不！别开枪！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Don't shoot! Don't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.49,0:07:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要离开城里，我建议你也这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm leaving town. I suggest you do the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.79,0:07:19.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,据报安布雷拉公司派出武装警卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've received reports of Umbrella Corporation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:35.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(艾莉丝计划开始启动)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.11,0:08:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(活死人横行)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请依序通过检查站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move in an orderly fashion to security checkpoints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.69,0:09:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,本市已遭污染，军队已全面封锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The city is completely contained. Troops have sealed all exits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唯一的出口就是这座桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only way out is this bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:05.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全体市民必须通过身体扫瞄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All citizens must pass through medical scanning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.07,0:09:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长官！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.57,0:09:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你最好过来看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better take a look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,家族成员必须一起通过检查站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Family members must pass through security checkpoints together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.71,0:09:17.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请依序前进，请勿奔跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please proceed in an orderly fashion. Do not run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.79,0:09:23.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他没问题，让他过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's clean. Let him pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.09,0:09:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下一个！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:26.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要推挤！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No pushing, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,排好队！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep in line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.43,0:09:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,直升机D，新命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chopper Delta, new orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.16,0:09:36.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,直接飞往黑门大桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proceed directly to Ravens Gate Bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.23,0:09:37.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里极需支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reinforcements urgently needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了，基地，马上到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that, base. On our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.03,0:10:05.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打开！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.10,0:10:08.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不！走开！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走开！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:12.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不！住手！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Stop! Get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.45,0:10:33.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不！退后！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.79,0:10:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有市民有麻烦！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Civilian in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:37.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,三点钟方向，快下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three o'clock. Go down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.63,0:10:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行！我们有任务！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't. We have our orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不！退后！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Get back! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们会杀了她的！快下去！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna kill her! Take us down now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她是老百姓，我们有任务在身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a civilian. We have orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.21,0:10:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去他的任务！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck orders!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尼寇莱！绑住我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicholai, tie me off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.74,0:10:56.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,退后！退后！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:10:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:14.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是现在！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:22.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我们下去！快！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take us down! Down, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.15,0:11:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hey, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.82,0:11:35.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别站在边缘，过来我这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step away from the edge. Come over to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:38.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:39.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不，会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.29,0:11:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我看过被咬过的人的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen what happens to you once you've been bitten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.59,0:11:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们能帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.93,0:11:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有活路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.03,0:11:48.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:06.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让开！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:07.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,培顿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peyton!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:09.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,培顿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peyton!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.05,0:12:10.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,范伦婷！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peyton! Valentine. Hey, Valentine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.39,0:12:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让开！警察！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Police! Move! {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.96,0:12:14.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让她过来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:18.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很高兴你来，我们需要帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad you're here. We could use the help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.73,0:12:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他心脏不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has a weak heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别靠近他！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.37,0:12:27.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家退后！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, stand back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸爸！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.47,0:12:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别靠近他！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.11,0:12:32.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把她拉开！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her away from him! It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拉开她！把她拉走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from him!Get her away from him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:37.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸爸！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.55,0:12:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系，有我在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快把他拉开！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him off! Get him off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,退后！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move aside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.63,0:12:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,病毒已经到达闸门了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's here. It's reached the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.57,0:13:01.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么还在这？你该趁早走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you here? You should've got out while you had the chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些是我们的同胞，吉儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are our people, Jill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.71,0:13:06.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,关闭闸门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close them. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长官？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.91,0:13:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,关闭闸门！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seal the gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们的人还在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our men are still out there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.05,0:13:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快关！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:40.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,本区是生化危害区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a biohazard quarantine area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由于有感染危险，你们不能离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Due to risk of infection, you cannot be allowed to leave the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是在搞什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:49.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们已采取所有适当措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All appropriate measures are being taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,状况已受到控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The situation is under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.39,0:13:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位请回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please return to your homes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.99,0:13:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你逃不掉的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't get away with this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.10,0:14:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们有五秒钟的时间回头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have five seconds to turn around and return to the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.25,0:14:16.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.01,0:14:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上级已授权可使用武器驱离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use of live ammunition has been authorized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.29,0:14:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们不能对百姓开枪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can't shoot people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.02,0:14:25.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}four!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.62,0:14:26.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们不会开枪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They won't fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.89,0:14:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.63,0:14:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 快叫他们回来！ - 二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get them back! - Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.63,0:14:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快走！一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:39.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家快走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, clear out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:10.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,K小队与R小队到1区会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kilo and Romeo squads, rendezvous at sector 01{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:12.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,歼灭敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and secure against enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.82,0:15:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,手榴弹！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grenade! Grenade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.37,0:15:45.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,3到7小队全数撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Squads three to seven are on full retreat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.24,0:15:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不，行动失败，无法控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir. Suppression measures have failed. We can't contain it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.41,0:15:54.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,传染速度出人意料的快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The infection is spreading faster than anyone anticipated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.28,0:15:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾胥佛博士！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Ashford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:15:59.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不是该坐上直升机了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shouldn't you be on the chopper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.28,0:16:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.05,0:16:04.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我奉命撤离你和其它科学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was instructed to get you and the other scientists out of the hot zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:06.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是安布雷拉公司的重要资产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too important to Umbrella to be at risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没有我女儿不走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not leaving without my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.73,0:16:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很对不起，但本市已经封锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, truly. But the city is sealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.86,0:16:18.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她可能没死，但我们找不到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She may have survived the crash, but we couldn't find her anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.67,0:16:22.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算她还活着，我也不能让她走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if she were still alive, I couldn't let her out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.31,0:16:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感染的危险太大了，请你谅解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The risk of infection is too great. You must understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你做你该做的事，我要留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do what you have to do.I'm staying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.54,0:17:03.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(第五级密码登入)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:05.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(密码取消)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.99,0:17:12.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(请求远端遥控)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(拒绝登入)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:25.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(登入成功)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:39.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(搜寻安琪拉艾胥佛)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(在拉昆市国中寻获)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定还有人活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There has to be someone left alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.86,0:17:55.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.53,0:17:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(搜寻中)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(寻获)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.96,0:18:54.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:55.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麦特！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Matt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,送她到拉昆市的机构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take her to the Raccoon City facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.29,0:19:00.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把她隔离，仔细观察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want her quarantined. Close observation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.87,0:19:07.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,准备注射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare her for exposure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:15.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,提升剂量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up the dosage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:17.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:27.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(搜寻中)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.53,0:19:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(寻获)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.09,0:19:38.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们得休息会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's stop somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.09,0:19:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们去哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.48,0:19:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这他妈究竟怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.19,0:19:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们朝人群中开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are shooting people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.49,0:19:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都是些无辜的老百姓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}innocent people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你俩应该做点什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.29,0:19:47.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们可是警察啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're the police{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.59,0:19:49.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.99,0:19:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get under cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.29,0:20:31.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们给我出去！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是我的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.33,0:20:34.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我躲在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm hiding here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:35.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里很大，我们可以一起躲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's big enough for all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.80,0:20:36.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,少说废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.67,0:20:37.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别激动！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, just cool it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把枪放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put the gun down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:46.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把枪放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put the gun down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.05,0:20:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,至于你，别激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, you, take it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.57,0:20:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用枪，它也会让你死在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a way to get yourself killed here, without get yourself shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.29,0:21:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是吉儿·范伦婷，对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jill Valentine, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.84,0:21:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还记得我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.84,0:21:06.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我报导过你几件案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I covered some of your cases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.39,0:21:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在你停职之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before your suspension.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.69,0:21:11.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,泰莉·莫瑞斯，第7台的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terri More Alice, Raccoon 7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:13.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经见过你干的所有事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen all your work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.49,0:21:16.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,兴趣而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.04,0:21:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,并非如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.39,0:21:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你现在播天气预报了，对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did weaponry there, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是培顿·威尔斯中士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Sergeant Peyton Wells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.51,0:21:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你手上拿着什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that you got there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.41,0:21:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的艾美奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Emmy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.40,0:21:31.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我们有人能幸存的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's if any of us make it out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.64,0:21:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,警方对那些玩意有何评论？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So does the Raccoon City Police Department have any comment on what those things are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.03,0:21:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我主判决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lord judgment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.03,0:21:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看吧，我将把恶灵带给世人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behold, I will bring evil upon these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.33,0:21:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果他们不再领悟我的圣言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For they have my packened onto my words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:50.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不再敬仰我主，但我拒绝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nor on my lord. But I rejected it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.63,0:21:54.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,醒来吧，远离尘世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awake, leave the dwelling dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.13,0:21:58.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,死者将与活人同行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dead shall walk amongst the living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.15,0:22:01.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,并给予他们惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And bring the damnation onto them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.73,0:22:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出色的演讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's quite a speech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.63,0:22:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,非常精彩，可以作为最后一个镜头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was great. That's gonna make the final cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.95,0:22:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.45,0:22:13.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.67,0:22:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还好吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.61,0:23:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.55,0:23:13.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.98,0:23:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是我妹妹，她生病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my sister. She's not well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.62,0:23:18.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许我能帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I can help. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.62,0:23:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.16,0:23:20.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.23,0:23:23.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给我出去！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.57,0:23:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在喂养她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're feeding her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.04,0:23:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真恶心！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.14,0:23:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别管我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just leave us alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.81,0:23:39.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.75,0:23:46.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要离开这里！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting out of here. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.22,0:23:49.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.19,0:23:56.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的老天！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.32,0:23:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快来帮忙！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, help us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.79,0:23:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.32,0:24:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快进去！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it in there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.13,0:24:17.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么鬼东西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.98,0:24:28.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那里！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.42,0:24:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.25,0:24:37.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么玩意？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is that thing? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.09,0:24:40.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你干嘛？快回来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? Get back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.02,0:26:51.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,培顿！泰莉！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peyton.Terri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.57,0:27:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,培顿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peyton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.60,0:27:07.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.72,0:27:09.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个爱尔兰学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Irish student.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.93,0:27:11.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不，他是苏格兰人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No he's Scottish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.72,0:27:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.15,0:27:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我算过有三只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I count three of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.52,0:27:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它们困住我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got us boxed in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.16,0:27:21.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.05,0:27:23.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,带她出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you get her out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.67,0:27:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.06,0:27:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老天爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.76,0:27:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们需要更多弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna need more ammo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.63,0:27:50.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没子弹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.35,0:28:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也没子弹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit. I'm out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.64,0:28:26.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让开！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.74,0:29:40.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是谁啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the fuck are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.68,0:29:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,疯狂大赛车！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}GTA, motherfucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.92,0:29:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好耶！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.82,0:29:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,十分！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten points!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.65,0:29:58.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长的不错啊，小妞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's damn looking good, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.35,0:30:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找别人去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask him to find out who's second air{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.79,0:30:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尤里！你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yuri. You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.26,0:30:43.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吃炸弹吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bite this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.04,0:31:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.18,0:31:01.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.60,0:31:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,撤退！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.28,0:31:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,往这边走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.95,0:31:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是奥利维拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Olivera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.15,0:31:49.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们遇袭，请派直升机撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been overrun. Request immediate chopper evac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.17,0:32:23.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们他妈的在这里做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck are we doing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.77,0:32:24.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.98,0:32:25.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.98,0:32:29.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道只有我一个人在担心我们何时会变成僵尸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I the only one who's not thinking we're not the grave yard people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.55,0:32:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧，有什么计划？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. What's the point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.29,0:32:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,留着命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.17,0:32:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就这样？就这样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it? That's it?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.79,0:32:39.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hem. That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.47,0:32:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们得找个地方暂时落脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to find somewhere to stop for a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.04,0:32:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不，我不认为这可行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think that's a good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.31,0:32:46.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能会有更多的怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There might be more of those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.25,0:32:49.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是有的话，我们早遇上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there were more, we'd have seen them by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.95,0:32:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道它们是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what they are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.25,0:32:54.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安布雷拉地下实验室的生化武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're bio-weapons from Umbrella labs beneath the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.59,0:32:56.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么这么清楚安布雷拉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come you know so much about Umbrella?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.49,0:32:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我曾为他们效过力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to work for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.43,0:33:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该死！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.06,0:33:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.60,0:33:05.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.20,0:33:08.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他受了伤，感染正在扩大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's wounded. The infection's spreading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.94,0:33:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.41,0:33:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你现在就该解决他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should take care of him now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.14,0:33:15.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再等下去就更难解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be more difficult later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.88,0:33:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.41,0:33:20.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.22,0:33:25.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到那时，我自会处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it comes to that I'll take care of it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.82,0:33:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,随你便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.89,0:33:34.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这无关个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.10,0:33:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但1个小时内，也许是两个小时，你就死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in an hour, maybe two you'll be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.87,0:33:41.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之后没多久，你就会变成它们那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And moments later, you'll become one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.80,0:33:44.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你会危及到朋友，试图杀害他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll endanger your friends, try to kill them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.54,0:33:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能还会成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}probably succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.98,0:33:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.38,0:33:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事实就是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just the way it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.05,0:34:01.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救命！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.67,0:34:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们人太多了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's too many of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.94,0:34:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快离开这里！往这边走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here. This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.76,0:35:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,T病毒感染已达危急程度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, T-virus infection has reached critical levels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.93,0:35:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(感染程度危急)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.17,0:35:19.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是个完美的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a perfect opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.97,0:35:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,务必记录所有数据资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ensure all data streams are recorded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.17,0:35:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,启动奈密司计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activate Nemesis Program now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.91,0:35:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(启动复仇邪神)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.73,0:35:49.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(镇静剂-静脉注射)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.53,0:35:51.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(肌肉松弛剂-自动停止)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.63,0:36:01.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔法呼叫基地，这是阿尔法呼叫基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfa ding to base. This is Alfa ding to base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.63,0:36:03.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回话，基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in, base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.93,0:36:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿！集中精力，战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, pay attention, solider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.63,0:36:09.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔法呼叫基地，这是阿尔法呼叫基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfa ding to base. This Alfa ding to base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.63,0:36:10.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回话，基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in, base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.63,0:36:13.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你保持注意力，好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stay focus. Alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.63,0:36:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是，长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.33,0:36:17.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔法呼叫基地，这是阿尔法 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfa ding to base. This Alfa {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.33,0:36:19.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么不回应我们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, yes. Why don't they respond go to us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.93,0:36:21.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么不让我们撤退，嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't they evac us, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.13,0:36:23.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.13,0:36:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么他们先送我们来这里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do they send us here in the first place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.73,0:36:25.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们没有任何机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We never stood a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.73,0:36:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们没有任何把握\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We We're not sure for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.03,0:36:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.83,0:36:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.93,0:36:43.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿！这里啊！我们在这里！嘿！过来！我们在这里！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Here! We're down here!Hey! Come! We're here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.70,0:36:45.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们要去哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.07,0:36:47.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们要在那里降落，快扶尤里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're landing there. Let's get Yuri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.64,0:36:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧，尤里，我们要出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Yuri. We're getting out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.34,0:36:52.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们好好安置你的，来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll get you fixed up. Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.66,0:37:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,撑着点，我们就快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, Yuri. We're almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.43,0:37:17.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不！别走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No! Don't leave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.00,0:37:19.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不！快下来！我们来了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down here! We're coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.97,0:37:21.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们投东西到医院，你看到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They dropped something on hosptial，did you see them？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.70,0:37:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许是无线电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe a radio,One that works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.50,0:37:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,照顾尤里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take Yuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.92,0:37:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,撑着点，尤里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, Yuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.02,0:38:38.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尼寇莱，放我下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicholai, put me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.36,0:38:41.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好，在这休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, rest here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.53,0:38:46.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.97,0:38:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来像是 武器箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like weapon cases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.84,0:38:54.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们不需要武器，我们要撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't need weapons. We need evacuation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.84,0:38:57.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些不是给我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These weren't meant for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.57,0:39:21.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有的是子弹！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plenty to go around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.76,0:39:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别开枪！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.19,0:39:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是神射手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.80,0:39:51.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢了！我欠你一次！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you! Owe you one, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.94,0:40:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈呀，外面还比较安全咧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! Maybe I was safer outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.77,0:40:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把枪从我脸上移开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them guns out of my damn face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.98,0:40:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托，你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Motherfucker, please. Look{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.15,0:40:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的家伙才正点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my shit is custom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.13,0:40:23.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么玩意？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.94,0:40:37.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,靠！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.39,0:40:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你死定了，大怪胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going down, you son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.72,0:40:52.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,靠！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.14,0:41:04.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,成防卫队形，撂倒他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deploy defensive formation. Take him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.31,0:41:09.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fuckers is crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.64,0:41:12.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个大怪物手上拿着火箭筒呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that guy, got a rocket launcher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.45,0:41:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么情况？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we have? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.45,0:41:15.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一队武装人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dozen armed men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.98,0:41:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,组织严密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well organized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.72,0:41:26.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我很惊讶竟然有人还能活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm surprised there's anyone left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.06,0:41:28.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们是S.T.A.R.S.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're S.T.A.R.S.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.43,0:41:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,特种战术援救小组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Special Tactics and Rescue Squad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.26,0:41:32.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们都是高手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.37,0:41:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开火！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.45,0:41:48.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,撤退！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back! Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.25,0:41:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看看他们有多行吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see how good they really are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.85,0:41:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,变更指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Altering protocols.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.55,0:41:56.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(杀光特种战术援救小组)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.71,0:42:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不堪一击！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S.T.A.R.S.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.98,0:42:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.36,0:42:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.49,0:42:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(武装平民　威胁：很低)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.83,0:42:41.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(非战斗人员　威胁：零)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.58,0:42:50.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,狗日的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the white motherfucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.08,0:42:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没权利操蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no right to do shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.83,0:42:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,狗娘养的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're one son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.59,0:42:59.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,操，我最屌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit. I'm a bad motherfucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.93,0:43:01.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,噢，我最屌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm a bad motherfucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.43,0:43:04.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我得离开这鬼地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'll get the fuck out of here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.23,0:43:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在看什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you staring at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.43,0:43:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.43,0:43:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么进的保护伞公司？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What made you one of the Umbrella?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.43,0:43:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,混口饭吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was gonna make a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.73,0:43:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的身手真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those were some pretty slick moves back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.16,0:43:27.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我很行，但还没有你行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good，but I'm not that good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.03,0:43:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你该庆幸这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be thankful for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.50,0:43:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.04,0:43:35.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们对我动了手脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They did something to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.11,0:43:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已经不太觉得自己是人类了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I barely feel human anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.35,0:43:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们继续前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.68,0:43:44.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,趁这声音还没引来怪物之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before the sound attracts anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.13,0:43:56.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.51,0:44:10.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.44,0:44:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还以为你们永远不会接电话呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I thought you'd never answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.94,0:44:13.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.21,0:44:16.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我能帮你们逃出拉昆市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can get you out of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.88,0:44:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们四个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All four of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.08,0:44:21.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但首先我们得做个约定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But first we have to come to an arrangement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.89,0:44:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们同意吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready to make a deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.42,0:44:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们有选择吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we have a choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.76,0:44:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有，想活过今晚就得答应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if you want to live past tonight, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.79,0:44:31.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是艾胥佛博士，他负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Dr. Ashford and he{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.73,0:44:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,负责安布雷拉的基因病毒研究部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Runs the genetics and viral research division of Umbrella Corporation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.83,0:44:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他要我们干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he want with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.47,0:44:39.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他女儿安琪拉被困在城里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His daughter, Angela, is trapped in the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.97,0:44:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安布雷拉公司原本应该要撤离她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Umbrella was to evac her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.14,0:44:44.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但行动失败，她目前躲在学校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but she didn't make it.She's hiding out in her school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.44,0:44:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找到她，他就会帮我们逃离此地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We find her, he'll help us escape the perimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.81,0:44:48.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想都别想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No fucking deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.28,0:44:52.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们会找栋门坚墙固的建筑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We find the building with the thickest walls and doors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.42,0:44:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,固守在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we barricade ourselves in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.15,0:44:55.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等待救援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit tight, wait for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.82,0:44:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会有人来救援的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There won't be any help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.16,0:45:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,博士说安布雷拉知道感染已失控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Umbrella knows they can't contain the infection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.03,0:45:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以等天一亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So at sunrise this morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.66,0:45:05.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拉昆市就会被彻底消毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raccoon City will be completely sanitized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.80,0:45:09.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么叫彻底消毒？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean by "sanitized"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.34,0:45:12.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个精密的战略性核子武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A precision tactical nuclear device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.47,0:45:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,威力多大？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What yield? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.44,0:45:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,相当于五千吨炸药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five kilotons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.68,0:45:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太扯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck me. Stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.44,0:45:18.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.28,0:45:22.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那可以摧毁感染的状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means it'll destroy the infection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.52,0:45:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有所有的证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all evidence of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.75,0:45:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这太过份了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's bullshit. It's bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.59,0:45:31.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们不可能盖过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No fucking way would they get away with that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.92,0:45:33.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,电视新闻会报导一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be all over the fucking news!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.13,0:45:34.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用藉口掩饰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cover-up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.09,0:45:36.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,藉口已经准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cover-up's already prepared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.93,0:45:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,核电厂的反应堆发生状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A meltdown at the nuclear power plant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.56,0:45:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一场悲剧性的意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A tragic accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.63,0:45:43.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安布雷拉不可能有办法掩饰一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even Umbrella is capable of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.74,0:45:46.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可能？培顿，你当时在现场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not capable? Peyton, you were there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.91,0:45:48.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就在桥头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.27,0:45:51.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你很清楚他们会无所不用其极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know exactly how far Umbrella will go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.68,0:45:57.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我们现在该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do we do now, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.68,0:46:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想我们天亮前要离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we should be out of here by sunrise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.22,0:46:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(搜寻中)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.73,0:46:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(寻获)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.62,0:46:08.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,万一根本没出路呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if there is no way out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.83,0:46:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他还变态的到处监视我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he's watching us on these cameras{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.08,0:46:15.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就像一种恶心的游戏？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like this is some kind of sick game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.53,0:46:17.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.43,0:46:18.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.90,0:46:19.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天亮可不会等我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sunrise ain't gonna wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.04,0:46:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不，下面有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.There's something down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.37,0:46:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.84,0:46:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.68,0:46:29.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没看到什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.08,0:46:33.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没看到并不代表没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't alter the fact that there is something down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.78,0:46:35.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我受够这一切了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting sick of this bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.45,0:46:37.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,培顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peyton!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.69,0:46:43.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.13,0:46:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他找到另外两个特种部队队员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's located another two S.T.A.R.S. Members.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.06,0:46:49.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(目标:范伦婷 培顿)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.17,0:46:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,复仇邪神，快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nemesis! Run! Just go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.37,0:46:56.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快逃啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.98,0:47:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,主要目标已确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Primary target is identified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.78,0:47:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位，我们等待的就是这一刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, this is what we've been waiting for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.52,0:47:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,2点18分27秒确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confirm at 2: 18 and 27 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.69,0:47:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,复仇邪神已全面启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Nemesis Program is now fully activated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.36,0:48:28.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(垃圾投弃口)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.79,0:49:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(战斗中止)
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.39,0:50:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你朋友的事我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm I'm sorry about your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.93,0:50:07.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们快去学校找这个小孩吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just get to the school and find this kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.10,0:50:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的老天！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This bite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.57,0:50:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不，培顿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No，Peyton!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.33,0:50:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伤口一直血流不止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it won't stop bleeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.70,0:50:50.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们怎么会没看到我们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't they see us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.80,0:50:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.87,0:50:55.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,直升机啊，我们就在医院前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chopper. We were right there in the street in front of the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.84,0:50:57.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们怎么会看不见我们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could they not see us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.68,0:50:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They saw us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.38,0:51:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这话什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.25,0:51:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们是资产，可牺牲的资产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're assets, Nicholai.Expendable assets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.69,0:51:10.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我们被牺牲掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we've just been expended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.07,0:51:25.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,停车！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.21,0:51:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不是活死人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not one of those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.68,0:51:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,记得我吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, remember me? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.88,0:51:32.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看，我没被咬到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I haven't been bitten or anything. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.45,0:51:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上车吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb aboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.62,0:51:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫杰佛森韦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lloyd Jefferson Wade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.79,0:51:44.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们可以叫我阿杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can call me L.J. On account of the informal situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.50,0:51:53.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(寻获安琪拉艾胥佛)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.87,0:52:33.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们得分开来找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna have to split up to search this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.54,0:52:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.78,0:52:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要！我不要自己一个人去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it! I'm not going out there by myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.91,0:52:39.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以跟你一起去找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.68,0:52:41.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你搜一楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, take the first floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.08,0:52:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你搜二楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, take the second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.62,0:52:45.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我搜地下室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take the basement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.65,0:52:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没有开过枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never shot a gun before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.42,0:52:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这很简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.53,0:52:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,瞄准，射击，重复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Point, pull, repeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.82,0:52:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,设法射他们的头部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to hit them in the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.63,0:53:28.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,瞄准，射击，重复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Point, pull, repeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.93,0:53:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,瞄准，射击，重复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Point, pull, repeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.49,0:54:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我看到你了，死骷髅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you, mother Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.33,0:54:39.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,噢，埃尔维斯！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Elvis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.37,0:54:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也接到电话了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So did you get the call as well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.14,0:54:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.21,0:54:45.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们是来找那女孩的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're here for the girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.48,0:54:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对，是，是为那女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, yeah. The girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.94,0:54:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾胥佛博士没说他还找了别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Ashford didn't say he made a deal with someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.35,0:54:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想我们算是伙伴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess we're partners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.64,0:55:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.25,0:55:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.23,0:55:33.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安琪拉，不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angela? It's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.07,0:55:35.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no need to be afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.11,0:55:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们会带你回家的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna take you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.18,0:55:45.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的老天！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.64,0:56:09.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,泰莉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terri?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.32,0:56:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你帮不了她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't help her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.69,0:56:33.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.86,0:56:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我看到他们把她吃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen what they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.77,0:56:39.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是安琪拉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you Angela?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.17,0:56:44.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对，我们得趁他们回来前赶快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes，We should hurry before they come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.91,0:56:46.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿着这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.25,0:56:54.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你叫安琪拉·艾胥佛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angela Ashford, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.38,0:56:57.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小女孩怎么叫这么成熟的名字？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a pretty grown-up name for a little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.92,0:57:01.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不是小女孩,而且\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a little girl. Besides{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.29,0:57:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我朋友都叫我安琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all my friends call me Angie. 　{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.32,0:57:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安琪？我喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angie, huh? I like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.97,0:57:14.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那些东西在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those things are in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.57,0:57:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们动作慢，我们可以绕过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, honey. They're slow. We can run around them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.80,0:57:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不，不是他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.Not them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.18,0:57:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.11,0:57:27.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.24,0:57:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别乱动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.78,0:57:59.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想你可能需要帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought you might need a hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.61,0:58:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是安布雷拉公司的人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You work for Umbrella?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.35,0:58:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以前是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Used to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.35,0:58:04.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,直到他们把我们扔在这里等死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until they left us for dead in this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.68,0:58:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我现在算是自由工作者了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I consider myself freelance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.72,0:58:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尼寇莱中士为你效劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant Nicholai Genovev, at your service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.60,0:58:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快跑！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.26,0:58:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.03,0:58:17.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安琪！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.60,0:58:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去救那个女孩！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save the girl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.66,0:58:20.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来对付这只死母狗！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got this bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.48,0:58:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.38,0:58:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从现在起，要紧跟着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From now on, stay right beside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.02,0:58:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,门被堵住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's blocked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.99,0:58:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.41,0:59:01.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.57,0:59:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小心看着, 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes, Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.80,1:00:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.77,1:00:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们认识？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two know each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.30,1:00:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她受过感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.51,1:00:43.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且是高度感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's infected on a massive level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.98,1:00:45.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.71,1:00:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为她也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because she is too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.51,1:00:48.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也被感染了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're infected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.95,1:00:50.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你打算什么时候才告诉我们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When were you gonna tell us that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.16,1:00:57.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.12,1:00:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.60,1:01:05.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道我不会伤害你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I'm not gonna hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.83,1:01:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.59,1:01:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是解毒剂，可以治愈T病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the antivirus, the cure to the T-virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.76,1:01:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有解毒剂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a cure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.63,1:01:36.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么会有？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.50,1:01:37.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.93,1:01:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爸爸帮我做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My daddy made it for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.13,1:01:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他瘫痪了，有一天我也会瘫痪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's sick. And someday, I'll get sick too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.54,1:01:45.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他只是想阻止那种情况发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just wanted to stop that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.31,1:01:47.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我小的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was little{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.67,1:01:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只能拄着拐杖走路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to walk on crutches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.74,1:01:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们说我再也不会变好了，只会变得更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said I'd never get better, just worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.92,1:01:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他发现了让我变强壮的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He found a way to make me stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.35,1:02:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,T病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The T-virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.72,1:02:05.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,后来他们夺走了他的发明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then they took the invention away from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.36,1:02:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,滚出我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of my house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.77,1:02:16.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他不是坏人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not a bad man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.74,1:02:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他无意造成这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't mean for any of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.27,1:02:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.92,1:02:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别开枪！他没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shoot! He's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.32,1:02:35.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他跟博士达成了协议，跟你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He made a deal with Dr. Doom, same as you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.46,1:02:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们有多少人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many of you guys are there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.53,1:02:42.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.33,1:02:48.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尼寇莱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicholai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.17,1:02:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你什么时候被咬的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When were you bitten?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.17,1:02:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,三小时前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.21,1:02:57.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,搞什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.95,1:03:02.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你今天走运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your lucky day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.02,1:03:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你该说你被咬了，我跟你一起耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should have told me you got bit. I'm hanging with you and shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.76,1:03:14.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我跟我女儿说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me speak to my daughter. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.09,1:03:16.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,首先，你得告诉我们怎么出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, you tell us how we're getting out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.86,1:03:21.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有一架直升机已经在待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a helicopter already being prepped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.57,1:03:24.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它将47分钟后起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It takes off in 47 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.54,1:03:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是引爆核弹前的最后一个架次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be the last transport to leave Raccoon City before they detonate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.37,1:03:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想这架直升机不是来接我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take it this helicopter isn't laid out just for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.04,1:03:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它有别的任务，但它没人看守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It has another purpose, but it'll be lightly guarded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.95,1:03:36.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,地点在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the evac site? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.72,1:03:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我现在能跟女儿说话了吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I speak to my daughter now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.49,1:03:43.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸爸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.02,1:03:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿，甜心，你还好吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, sweetheart. Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.53,1:03:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我什么时候能看到你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When can I see you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.96,1:03:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.03,1:03:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些人很快就会带你来见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These people will bring you to see me. I'll see you very soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.33,1:03:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,叫那个姐姐来听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put the lady back on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.90,1:03:56.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们该去哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do we have to go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.67,1:03:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,直升机停在市政厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The helicopter will be at city hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.81,1:04:01.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我建议你们动作快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest you make haste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.15,1:04:09.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(连接失败)
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.88,1:04:13.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,电脑, 真靠不住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computers, so unreliable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.89,1:04:23.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.77,1:04:31.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真以为我不知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really thought I didn't know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.95,1:04:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你帮我注射什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what are you injecting me with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.12,1:04:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,解毒剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The antivirus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.29,1:04:52.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,T病毒重新活化死去的细胞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The T-virus reanimates dead cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.89,1:04:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让死人活过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Basically, bringing the dead to life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.86,1:05:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或让活人产生无法控制的突变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or in a living human, it can cause uncontrollable mutation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.30,1:05:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它让她得以再度行走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or it can help her walk again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.93,1:05:04.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要继续以这玩意控制病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if the virus is kept in check with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.00,1:05:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安琪也受到了感染？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angie's infected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.24,1:05:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对，细胞的成长足以让她再生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.The cellular growth is enough to regenerate her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.11,1:05:12.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,却不会让她更进一步突变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not enough to cause mutation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.65,1:05:14.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们让你也受到T病毒感染？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they infected you with the T-virus as well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.51,1:05:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.48,1:05:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过别担心，我没有传染危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't worry. I'm not contagious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.16,1:05:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.26,1:05:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,录下整个故事，我会让它物有所用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tape the story. I'll see that it gets put to good use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.46,1:05:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.43,1:05:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我曾为安布雷拉公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I worked for the Umbrella Corporation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.34,1:05:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,世上最大最强的公司效命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the largest and most powerful commercial entity in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.34,1:05:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我担任保安主任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was head of security{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.94,1:05:46.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,负责保护“蜂巢”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at a secret high-tech facility called The Hive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.95,1:05:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个发展实验性生化武器的地下高科技实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a giant underground laboratory developing experimental viral weaponry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.65,1:06:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.27,1:08:28.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你漏了一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.64,1:09:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们得快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.61,1:09:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没问题的，有的是时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're okay. We have time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.74,1:09:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不，我们得快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! We have to hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.91,1:09:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈呀，我们偷的是他的直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit! We stealing his ride!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.28,1:09:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.55,1:09:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我说，起飞！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, take off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.99,1:09:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,急什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the rush?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.86,1:09:19.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们一直在等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been expecting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.13,1:09:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,周边已肃清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perimeter secure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.10,1:09:26.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有区域都已封锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All sectors locked down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.21,1:09:36.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安琪！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.24,1:09:37.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸爸！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.41,1:09:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就知道你不会丢下我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you wouldn't leave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.45,1:09:42.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然，永远不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.78,1:09:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放下武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Discard primary weaponry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.40,1:10:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们两个展现出无比的潜力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The two of you showed such promise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.40,1:10:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我们得看你们动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we had to see you in action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.14,1:10:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用你们的必杀技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And most impressive you've been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.84,1:10:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们就像兄妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're like brother and sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.81,1:10:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,身手无比快速、强壮、敏捷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heightened speed, strength, agility. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.88,1:10:13.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有相同的杀手本能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the same killer instincts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.01,1:10:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,两个同时进行的研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parallel strands of research.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.32,1:10:19.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在，我们将知道谁比较强了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now Now we'll discover which is superior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.45,1:10:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟他决斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.39,1:10:26.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.36,1:10:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟他决斗，否则他们就死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight him, or they die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.63,1:10:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你凭什么认为我会在乎？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you think I care?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.87,1:10:40.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸爸，不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy! Daddy, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.14,1:10:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.61,1:10:47.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他原本是公司的重要资产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a valuable asset to the corporation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.75,1:10:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我根本不在乎这些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even care about these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.29,1:11:03.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,动手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.79,1:13:44.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在突变，把他纳入奈密司计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's mutating. I want him in the Nemesis Program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.09,1:13:48.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麦特！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Matt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.20,1:13:54.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,细胞结构瓦解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cellular structure breaking down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.00,1:13:57.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,T病毒出现基因突变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}T-virus is manifesting itself in a genetic mutation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.94,1:14:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们发现相同的细胞再生情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're seeing similar cellular regeneration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.85,1:14:08.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.42,1:14:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麦特，对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Matt. I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.82,1:14:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,解决他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.49,1:14:21.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫你解决他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, finish him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.46,1:14:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.57,1:14:31.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还不明白你对我有多重要吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you understand how important you are to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.77,1:14:33.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那怪物虽然很强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That creature is one thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.34,1:14:37.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但你与T病毒却结合了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you somehow you bonded with the T-virus on a cellular level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.24,1:14:40.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你适应并改变了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You adapted it, changed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.28,1:14:42.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你成了无敌超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You became magnificent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.81,1:14:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我成了怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I became a freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.05,1:14:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.22,1:14:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不是突变，你是进化了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not mutation. You're evolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.02,1:14:53.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想想有了我帮忙，你会变得多强？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With my help, just imagine what you can achieve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.73,1:14:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那他呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.16,1:15:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,演化自有其尽头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evolution has its dead ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.37,1:15:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快解决这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, finish this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.37,1:15:05.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让他死个痛快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put him out of his misery{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.41,1:15:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后跟我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.24,1:15:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.18,1:15:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我对你真失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're such a disappointment to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.45,1:15:24.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,充满力量却不用，真浪费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that strength，but no will to use it. What a waste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.73,1:15:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,准备起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare for takeoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.00,1:15:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听我号令开始彻底消毒拉昆市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sanitation of Raccoon City to commence on my mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.88,1:15:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杀了她！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.76,1:16:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.64,1:16:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快升空！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get us airborne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.30,1:16:31.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是最高指挥肯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Cain. Priority overload.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.47,1:16:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开始发射程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initiate launch proceedings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.37,1:16:35.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,倒数五分钟后引爆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Detonation set at T-minus 5 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.51,1:16:45.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安琪，趴下！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angie, get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.36,1:16:54.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么还不起飞？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why haven't we taken off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.66,1:16:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为我比较习惯开凯迪拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I usually drive a Cadillac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.48,1:17:20.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,投降，否则格杀勿论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surrender, or we open fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.61,1:17:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放下武器！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.62,1:18:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾莉丝！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.13,1:18:09.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放下武器投降！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop your weapon and surrender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.77,1:18:49.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快把这玩意开上天！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get this thing in the air!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.84,1:18:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你得站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.35,1:19:04.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麦特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Matt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.26,1:19:07.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧，我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, we have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.79,1:19:08.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们得走了，来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.16,1:19:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.54,1:19:25.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,起来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.51,1:19:30.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你别指望我会下跪求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you expect me to beg, I will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.82,1:19:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.66,1:19:45.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杀了我并不能解决事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killing me won't put things right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.10,1:19:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.90,1:19:49.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但这至少是个开始！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's a start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.07,1:21:03.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不会有事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you going to be all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.81,1:21:39.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家抓稳了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on to something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.69,1:21:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们要坠机了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.23,1:22:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(拉昆市郊亚克雷山区)
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.90,1:22:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(两小时后)
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.70,1:22:39.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,UG9报告基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}U-Gamma 9 to base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.37,1:22:41.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,确认已找到坠机地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confirmation.We've located the crash site.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.38,1:22:55.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快派医疗小组过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fetch the medical team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.69,1:22:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其他人呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.69,1:23:01.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有发现其他尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no other bodies found, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.84,1:23:18.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拉昆市的意外有了初步报导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have unconfirmed reports of disaster at Raccoon City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.17,1:23:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,本台获得这些骇人的画面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These shocking images just in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.41,1:23:24.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一场神秘瘟疫或病毒感染导致局势失控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mysterious plague or viral outbreak has run rampant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.31,1:23:26.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安布雷拉公司害死无辜平民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Implicating Umbrella Corporation in deaths of innocent citizens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.05,1:23:31.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是拉昆第七台的泰莉所拍摄的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This tape, work of former Raccoon 7 anchorwoman Terri Morales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.52,1:23:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新证据推翻先前的报导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New evidence now discredits earlier reports{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.19,1:23:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,显示那只是一个恶作剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing more than sick joke. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.96,1:23:37.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假影带完全被推翻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fake videotape totally discredited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.99,1:23:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那只是一个恶作剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing more than a big hoax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.90,1:23:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿拉昆市稍早的悲剧来开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Playing on the very real tragedy which overwhelmed Raccoon City this week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.97,1:23:47.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,核电厂反应炉发生重大意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The reactor at the nuclear power station went critical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.44,1:23:52.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是自1986年，前苏联切尔诺贝利事件后最大的核子灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The worst atomic disaster since the Russian Chernobyl incident in 1986.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.31,1:23:54.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,州长特别致意安布雷拉公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The state governor personally thanked the Umbrella Corporation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.04,1:23:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感谢其迅速处理善后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for their swift action{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.48,1:24:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恶作剧的吉儿和卡洛斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The perpetrators of the hoax, Jill Valentine and Carlos Olivera{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.18,1:24:03.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,目前已被警方留置侦讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now being sought for questioning by the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.42,1:24:09.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(拉昆市意外发生三周后)
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.69,1:24:12.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(安布雷拉医学研究机构)
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.10,1:24:23.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾莉丝 艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice Alice {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.31,1:24:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾莉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.61,1:24:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,醒醒！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.85,1:24:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你听得见我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.62,1:24:41.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你听得懂我说的话吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand what I'm saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.93,1:24:45.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.53,1:24:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开始清洗程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Begin the purging process.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.73,1:25:22.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她复原的速度惊人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her recovery's remarkable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.63,1:25:25.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有她的力量，不论生理或心理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And her powers, both physical and mental{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.47,1:25:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都以等比级数的程度增加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are developing at a geometric rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.45,1:25:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪 哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.08,1:25:42.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在哪里吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.25,1:25:44.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.35,1:25:46.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你很安全，来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're safe，Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.16,1:25:52.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好，就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.There we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.64,1:26:07.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道那是什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what that is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.11,1:26:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是一支笔，你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a pen，You see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.88,1:26:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.99,1:26:19.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.{\r}
